    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warning : This game is built like a puzzle game where you have to find out how to play by yourself and win.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be left without a tutorial and the goal is to find the secret true ending of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or challenge a friend in a 1v1 Duel where only the smartest wins every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two races compete over one city </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achieve one of the 5 victory types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can use your enemy's building, but be careful, he can use yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mix between European board games and sid meier's civilization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Which kind of victory are you going to achieve?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modes :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Hotseat against a friend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Online Multiplayer with Steam Friend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Against the AI (4 races to fight with increasing difficulty)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warning : This game is built like a puzzle game where you have to find out how to play by yourself and win.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be left without a tutorial and the goal is to find the secret true ending of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or challenge a friend in a 1v1 Duel where only the smartest wins every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two races compete over one city </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achieve one of the 5 victory types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can use your enemy's building, but be careful, he can use yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mix between European board games and sid meier's civilization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Which kind of victory are you going to achieve?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modes :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Hotseat against a friend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Online Multiplayer with Steam Friend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Against the AI (4 races to fight with increasing difficulty)</p>",
    "short_description": "Khan VS Kahn is a turn-based strategy game where two races compete over one city by achieving one of the 5 victory types Find out how to play and find the secret ending or challenge a friend in a 1v1 Duel. You can use your enemy's building, but be careful, he can use yours!",
